<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.450
Motto To LOVE-Ru 31

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.450
<u>All Quiet On The "Sister" Front</u>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.440
Y-Yuuki-san!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.990
P-Please go out with me!

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.280
Um...

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.200
I'm sorry.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.200
How can this be?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.500
Amazing!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.870
She even shot down Ooyoshi-kun from Class C! {Did i get that name right?}

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.500
W-Why?!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:57.720
Hey Mikan-chan, even though you're popular among the boys, how come you don't go out with any of them?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:58.800
Eh?

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.640
Well, that's because I'm not really interested in stuff like that.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.730
It's because Mikan has a wonderful Onii-chan!

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.140
Wh-What's that got to do with anything? {TLC}

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:12.190
The way you try to desperately hide it... How suspicious! {TLC}

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.650
In what way is your Onii-chan wonderful?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.110
Let me meet him next time!

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.530
He's not as good as you think! {gamma- yeah he can't even make me cum 3 times wtf}

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.170
Wonderful Onii-chan... eh?

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.340
Take that!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.560
Ah... I lost again!

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:49.060
Sis! Let me have a go at it next.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.850
Nana, you've played this before?

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.360
Nope, but it'll be fine.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.320
This game is a piece of cake. {TLC}

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.610
Rito-san, you're really skilled at this!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.780
I'm pretty good with games.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.620
<i>Momo-san...</i>

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:09.870
<i>...aren't you attached to Rito a bit too much lately?</i>

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.750
<i>And Rito too... He's always so clueless about these things...</i>

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:25.720
Eh? Keep some distance from Rito-san? {TLC}

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:26.850
Yeah.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.100
I want you to be more aware of it.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.600
And what's more, you're interfering with Lala-san as well. {gamma- Originally said "in front of Lala-san" | Sounds weird so I'm guessing that's a translated form of "interfering" or "in the way of" Lala since she likes Rito}

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.560
Ah...

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:42.860
Also, sometimes you sneak into Rito's room at night, right?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.320
Although I don't know what your intention is...

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.580
So you knew about it?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:51.210
In that case, why don't you join us, Mikan-san?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.540
I'm just kidding!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:56.920
Sorry!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:01.630
I was half-asleep and I accidentally went into Rito-san's futon!

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.880
From now on, I'll be more careful!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.720
How suspicious!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:29.490
From the look in Momo-san's eyes, it seems she has no intention of stopping.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.300
If Momo-san comes, I'll be sure to teach her a lesson.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.140
She's not coming...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.860
Sleeping like a baby...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:04.280
It's because you're like that... it's really tough being your little sister.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.410
Do you understand? Hey.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.040
W-Where are you touching?

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:21.170
A delicious marshmallow...

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.130
That's not a marshmallow...

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.190
R-Rito...

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.150
Cut it out!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.070
Ouch... the marshmallow bit me...

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.400
Oh dear...

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.500
What on earth am I doing?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.460
And there's no sign of Momo-san either.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.130
I guess I should go...

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:23.150
I'm really scared of thunder at night.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.820
You're still scared of thunder?

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:35.080
It'll be fine, your brother is here...

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.870
<i>Oh yeah...</i>

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.330
<i>This also happened a long time ago...</i>

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.180
<i>I'm feeling calmer because...</i>

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.560
<i>...of Rito's never changing scent.</i>

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:13.120
W-Why... is Mikan sleeping on my bed?!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.710
N-No, Rito! I was just-

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.460
So it's like that, Mikan-san...

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.300
Momo!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.420
When did you come into the room?!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:32.800
I didn't think that you had this kind of relationship... Sorry!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.310
D-Don't get the wrong idea!{Don't interpret the wrong situation here!}

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.600
What's with you two?!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:50.070
Motto To LOVE-Ru 32

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:50.070
<u>False Love</u>

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.280
Wait!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.280
I was too careless!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.030
She sneakily drank the Coke in the fridge...

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.490
Celine-chan gets drunk from drinking Coke?

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.410
It's not only that.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.700
If we don't catch her quickly...

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.380
You are... Yuuki Rito's...

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.220
Gotcha!{added, TLC OMG!! -masat}

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.770
You still want to drink Coke?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.310
All right, I'm going home...

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.900
Princess.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:30.650
May I borrow Rito for a while?

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.400
Sure!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.990
We're going home first then!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.950
There's a taiyaki shop that I highly recommend. {TLC}

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.500
I'll treat you.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.840
I'll have the usual, 20.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.550
I never thought that Yami would be hit by the pollen. {TLC}

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:56.720
All right! I gave you extra, Yami-chan.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.720
Enjoy eating them with your boyfriend!

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.760
Boyfriend...

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.770
Here. Please eat.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.400
Thanks. I'll have some then...

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.950
Here Ta-kun, say "ah!"

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.990
Ah!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:20.990
Is it delicious?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.000
Yuuki Rito.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.290
I will feed you.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.550
Is it delicious?

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.680
I thought I was going to die...

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:48.350
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.400
Yami, your outfit, it's...

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:56.990
I changed it with my Trance ability to match the people around me.{what did we name the skill? Trance? Trans?}

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.990
So you can change your clothes like Peke... {TLC}

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:04.500
Since I'm using Trance, I can't maintain this for a long period of time. {TLC}

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.420
H-How is it?

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.420
It suits you.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.840
I think it's really cute.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.090
I see...

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.930
Yami actually developed an interest in clothes...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.390
Is this also an effect of the pollen?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:33.900
Please stop staring at me like that.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.030
Sorry!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.450
You need to watch where you're going carefully!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.670
Perverts...

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.630
I'm gonna be killed!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.630
I do hate them, but...

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:04.260
...I feel I'll be okay if I give in to it.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.430
I know...

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.060
...that I am not how I usually am.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:18.780
But, if this feeling is what I want to explore...

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:25.950
This mood, this sense of security... I want to try and feel more of it.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.410
So...

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:34.920
Would it be okay with you... if you gave me something called a "kiss"?

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:41.050
I want to try and see what kind of feelings would emerge...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:46.470
...and how deep the meaning of a simple kiss can be.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.190
You can't!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.480
This is not like the usual Yami.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.400
Hurry up and return to your usual self, Yami!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.820
Ah, it fell off!

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.440
So you're back-

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.570
Please don't touch me so casually.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.200
She's definitely back.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.670
Why did you say we can't?

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.880
About... the kiss.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.840
Why, you ask...?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.090
Well, it was because you did it out of curiosity and...

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.510
Furthermore, it's not something I should do when you're not in your normal mental state, right?

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:33.440
If I did, it would've hurt you. {TLC}

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.610
You're an idiot, aren't you?

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.400
Being so nice to a person who wants your life... {TLC}

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.440
But...

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.160
...I don't hate idiots.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.830
She's smiling?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.910
So when the time comes for me to kill you, I'll make sure you die a comfortable death.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:09.350
Motto To LOVE-Ru 33

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:09.350
<u>Predicting Love</u>

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.690
N-No...!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.360
Momo!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:23.650
You're here again...!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.240
Rito! Breakfast is ready, she said.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.280
Mikan-

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.120
What're you doing to Momo?!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.700
No! You got it wrong! When I woke up, Momo was...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.700
You traitor!{uragirimono!}{Traitor to Lala, I guess}

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.750
Did you really sneak into Rito's futon?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.380
Yes... so?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.710
Honestly... Why? With that beast... {TLC beast/brute kedamono}

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:47.800
Anyway, isn't that guy Sis' fiancé?

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:52.060
It's because I just think of myself as Rito's lover.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.690
I just don't understand.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.060
What's so good about that Yuuki Rito?

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.400
He's not strong.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.570
He's actually quite weak.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.450
What an interesting face!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.070
What's up with him? {TLC}

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.090
I'm very sorry, Miss.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.510
Thanks to you, I'm safe.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.010
Don't worry about it.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.310
However, you're a human, and yet you understand what I'm saying.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.560
This is an ability I was born with.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.600
I'm Nana.

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.810
I'm Sairenji Maron. {lol he adopts Haruna's surname}

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.110
I'm a haughty Boston Terrier. {TLC}

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.690
What are you doing out by yourself?

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:46.990
Where's your mistress?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:49.360
We got separated when we were taking a stroll.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:54.870
Somehow, I got distracted by something moving in front of my eyes. {TLC}

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.620
It's shameful, now that I mention it.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.670
I couldn't restrain myself when I lost control. {TLC}

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.750
To put it simply, you're lost.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:07.670
If you'd like, I'll help you find your mistress. {GAMMA TLC- SHOUGANAINAA NOT SHOUGANAI - OF COURSE IT CAN BE HELPED SHE JUST SAID SHE'D HELP IN THE SAME SENTENCE OMG lol I mad jk}

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:08.550
Really?

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.430
You'll become a good bride one day, Miss.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.800
Tell me your Mistress's characteristics.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.060
My Mistress's characteristics are...

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.190
Her sweet scent makes you warm inside... {TLC}

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.650
Scent?!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.770
Tell me a characteristic which is identifiable for humans!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.900
Even if you ask me...

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:28.190
Oh yeah!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:31.320
Mistress is troubled by love right now!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.160
Like I care!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.830
She's always thinking about a guy...

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.990
...called Yuuki Rito.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.580
That kind of information isn't really...

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:41.960
Yuuki Rito?

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.080
Maron?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.920
Maron, you're all right.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:48.210
Geez, you ran off so quickly.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:49.760
Eh?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.670
Nana-chan?

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.430
Haruna.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:00.020
That surprised me.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.150
Haruna likes Yuuki Rito...

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.150
Thank goodness!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.400
My old clothes fit you well.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.820
Feel free to take a seat.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:12.070
I'll prepare some drinks.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.660
I feel kind of bad...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.450
What are you saying?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.540
You did save Maron after all, so it's the least I can do.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:20.830
Hello!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.500
Who are you?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.290
She's my older sister.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.290
I'm Akiho.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.880
Nice to meet you, Nana-chan.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.050
Nice to meet you too.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:33.300
As expected of Lala-chan's little sister.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.430
So cute!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.720
Cute? I am?

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.020
Yeah! Don't you know that?

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.430
Hey Onee-chan!

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.310
You're troubling Nana-chan, right?

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.900
Eh? Are you jealous, Haruna-kun?

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:50.860
When you were small, didn't you go "Onee-chan, onee-chan!" and ask me to give you hugs? {TLC}

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.820
That never happened!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.530
It did!

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.610
Did not!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.700
Haruna-chan likes her sister.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:56.990
Did too! You're blushing?

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.120
Am not!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:02.370
You were so cute back then, Haruna.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.660
You wouldn't stop saying, "I love you, Onee-chan!"

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.460
What is this rising urge of excitement I am feeling?

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.130
Stop it!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.970
Hey, Maron!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.220
What's wrong?

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.220
Nana-chan's tail is her weak point.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.480
Is everyone from Deviluke like that?

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.310
It's different for everyone.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:32.070
It's just me and my sisters. Our tails are really sensitive.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:37.070
Oh no! It's already this late. {TLC Konna jikan = this time?}

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.030
Where are you going, Onee-chan?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.330
I need to meet someone. {TLC yakusoku = promise/agreement?}

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.490
A date?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.460
I only got to know him recently.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.710
He doesn't seem like a bad guy, so I'm going to play with him for a while.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.250
See ya, Nana-chan!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.000
Take your time.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.220
P-Play...

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.470
Your sister talks like an adult, Haruna.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.180
Geez... even though she has no real intention of falling in love and such...

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.390
What about you, Haruna?

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.980
Yuuki Rito... Um...

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.570
Would you want to date him and do stuff...?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.910
It's becoming very cloudy.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.790
It might rain.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.410
Will Nana be all right?

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.080
Where did she go off to?

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:32.090
Haruna, you like him, right?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:35.420
Nana-chan, how'd you find out?

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:39.090
You know I can talk to animals, right?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.510
Maron told me.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:42.800
Maron did?!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.680
That's not good! Idiot, idiot!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:49.730
Don't worry, I have no intention of telling anyone else.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.810
I just wanted to ask you.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:58.950
Momo, Sis, and even Haruna...

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.490
What's so good about that Yuuki Rito?

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.990
I just don't understand his qualities.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.750
That's because, he doesn't have a care in the world, right?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.000
He's not strong, and he's indecisive. {TLC}

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.210
Nana-chan.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.210
The wonderful thing about Yuuki-kun is...

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:22.220
...when you're with him, you get a really warm feeling.{...when you think of him, you get really naked. Wait, what? -masat}

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.720
A warm feeling?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.810
Yeah. It's not much of a reason.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:33.520
I'm sure Lala-san feels the same.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.230
I still don't understand.{me neither --a -masat}{neither do i -gamma}

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:41.320
If you're with Yuuki-kun, then I'm sure you'd understand.

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:43.910
Haruna.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:44.780
Yes?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.750
You haven't told Rito that you like him, right?

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:58.000
Maybe he's taking Sis into consideration and hiding his own feelings.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.300
That's...

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.220
That may be true...

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:11.690
After all, Lala-san is an important friend of mine.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:16.560
If Lala-san finds out about my feelings,

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:22.400
we might not be able to be friends like we've been up till now. {TLC}

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.870
It's all right to stay a little bit longer. {TLC}

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.580
Sis and Momo will worry about me.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.790
Thanks for washing my clothes!{lol did she just say "uguu"? -masat}{she said fuku, nice try masat lol}

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.010
Love... is really troublesome.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:52.560
This is not good. My clothes were just washed too.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.100
Hey!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.480
Rito?

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.570
Thank goodness! I found you before it started pouring.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.980
Here's an umbrella.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.490
Don't tell me you were actually looking for me?

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:09.910
Yeah. Lala and the others were also worried about you.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:16.290
<i>When you're with him, you get a really warm feeling.</i>

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.790
Hm? What's wrong?

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:21.250
Nothing.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.180
How the hell do you use this? You playboy. {onnatadarashii}

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:28.090
Don't call me bad names!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.560
Hey, wait!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:39.480
<i>Maybe he's taking Sis into consideration and hiding his own feelings.</i>

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:43.990
<i>After all, Lala-san is an important friend of mine.</i>

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:47.700
<i>But...</i>

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.240
<i>...I've been hiding my own feelings all along.</i>

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:56.500
<i>Can I really call myself a true friend of hers?</i>

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.010
Haruna!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:16.730
What's wrong?

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:18.440
You don't look well.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:21.110
Eh? It's nothing.

00:22:25.740 --> 00:22:27.360
You don't seem to have a fever.

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:29.070
Thank goodness!

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:32.660
I was worried about what I should do if you were ill!

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:34.040
Worry?

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.120
Yep.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:39.080
After all, Haruna-chan is an important friend of mine.

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.170
What's wrong?

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:52.970
Lala-san.

00:22:55.890 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>I've been hiding my feelings all along.</i>

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.770
<i>I can't call myself your real friend.</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:04.610
Haruna?

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:08.280
Lala-san, I also...

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:18.330
...like... {gamma- The way it was split before was odd as "like" showed up when Haruna said Yuuki-kun due to japanese and their wonderful grammar... as it is now it's more accurate but i'm not sure which way you like it better. kinda long pause though}

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.170
...Yuuki-kun.

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:51.070
<b>itsumo no jikan ni machiawasete</b>

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:51.070
<b>いつもの時間に待ち合わせて</b>

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:51.070
<b>I'm waiting for you at the usual time,</b>

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>chikoku shite terekakushi</b>

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>遅刻して照れ隠し</b>

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:53.990
<b>Hiding my embarrassment because I'm late.</b>

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:58.120
<b>damari komi kimete aruki dasuno</b>

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:58.120
<b>黙りこみ決めて歩き出すの</b>

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:58.120
<b>I walk beside you without saying a word.</b>

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.750
<b>share ni nattenai!</b>

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.750
<b>シャレになってない!</b>

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.750
<b>This joke is not funny.</b>

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:07.210
<b>yume ni miteta koto konya kanai sou</b>

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:07.210
<b>夢に見てたこと 今夜叶いそう</b>

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:07.210
<b>What I saw in the dream might come true tonight.</b>

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:13.260
<b>dakedo ne watashi kara janaku</b>

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:13.260
<b>だけどね 私からじゃなく</b>

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:13.260
<b>But you know, it shouldn't come from me.</b>

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:20.310
<b>anata no yuuki de kime naku cha</b>

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:20.310
<b>あなたの勇気でキメなくちゃ</b>

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:20.310
<b>I need you to pluck up the courage to decide.</b>

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:27.480
<b>koishiteru kono kanji</b>

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:27.480
<b>恋してる この感じ</b>

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:27.480
<b>Falling in love... This feeling...</b>

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:35.200
<b>romanchikkuna yume wo misasete</b>

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:35.200
<b>ロマンチックな夢を見させて</b>

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:35.200
<b>Let us witness romantic sweet dreams.</b>

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:43.500
<b>koishiteru kono omoi kokoro kara</b>

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:43.500
<b>恋してる この想い 心から</b>

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:43.500
<b>Falling in love... This feeling in my heart...</b>

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:51.420
<b>afure dashiteru baby love</b>

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:51.420
<b>溢れ出してる baby love</b>

00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:51.420
<b>...is overflowing with baby love.</b>

